SUMMARY:Comedy & Karaoke with S.O.F.I.A.!
DESCRIPTION:Join us in less than two weeks for an afternoon of laughter and music\nas we raise funds for S.O.F.I.A.’s START FRESH program. \nDate: Sunday\, May 17\, 2026\nTime: 2:00 PM – 5:00 PM\nLocation: Just Jake’s\, 30 Park Street\, Montclair\, NJ\nDonation: $25 \nJoin host DJ Corey Anderson and Montclair’s own Glen “Rated G” Sellers for comic stylings. along with karaoke performances from special guests and YOU! We will have raffles from local businesses as well. \nTickets for the event at Just Jake’s are a suggested donation of $25. please use our PayPal or CashApp to donate.\nLimited tickets will be available at the door. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
